  "warnings": [],
  "working_thesis": "Action and speech, rooted in human plurality and natality, reveal the unique distinctness of human agents and generate power and stories, but their inherent unpredictability, irreversibility, and boundlessness lead to historical perils that traditional political thought has attempted to remedy through rule, making, and fabrication."
